<title>AUSTRALIA: Cricket-Sheffield Shield standings.</title>
<headline>Cricket-Sheffield Shield standings.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE, Australia 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sheffield Shield cricket standings after the match completed on Monday (tabulate under played, won outright, won on first innings, drawn, lost on first innings, lost outright, points):</p>
<p> Queensland		5   3   1   0   0   1   20</p>
<p> Western Australia     5   3   1   0   0   1   20</p>
<p> New South Wales	 6   2   1   0   1   2   13.8</p>
<p> Victoria		  6   2   0   0   1   3   11.7</p>
<p> Tasmania		  5   1   1   0   1   2    8</p>
<p> South Australia	 5   1   0   0   1   3    6</p>
<p>Note: New South Wales penalised 0.2 points for slow over rate in their match against Tasmania, Victoria penalised 0.3 points for the same reason in the game against New South Wales.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
